  "scope": "Compact sparse worker-owned connection arenas above256 slots at <=1/8 occupancy; rekey stable token lookup and exact timer deadlines; preserve socket/payload owners and partial decoder/output state. Previously compacted arenas fully release at empty-worker cleanup. Small ordinary arenas remain warm. Six population,12 routing and6 fanout comparison cases ran sequentially with no build/profiler/competing load overlap.",
